ai-in-sdlc-github-analysis/
*.egg-info/
*.py[cod]

# Scratch at the repository ROOT only, every pattern anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, these
# match at every depth: `*.yml` swallowed `.github/workflows/`, `*.json` swallowed the UI's own
# configuration — which is why ui/.gitignore had to negate it back — and `completed/` swallowed
# docs/plans/completed/, where every finished plan lives.
/*.yml
/*.json
/*.log
/*.out
/*.gz
/completed/
/data/
/output/
.claude/settings.local.json
